# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
# .env is COMMITTED intentionally for this project — it contains the Supabase
# + R2 credentials needed for the app to run on Vercel without manual env setup.
# Commenting out the ignore so `git add .env` works.
# .env*
!.env
!.env.local

